# backups
*~
*.bak

# build
build*/

# python
__pycache__/

# ai tools
.agents/
.claude/
.codex/

# tmp
tmp/

# docs
docs/references/*.pdf
docs/welcome_back_template.md

# tools
tools/build/

# projects
projects/*/*.fingerprint
projects/*/*.peaks
projects/*/*.wav
projects/*/peaks/
projects/*/renders/
# THE SHEET TREE STAYS LOCAL EXCEPT THE MAP (2026-08-20). The rip, the
# trimmed clip and the extraction workdir are big, private and
# regenerable; sheet.map is small, hand-verified and the one thing a
# checkpoint must carry, so the score jump survives a fresh clone.
# The pattern ignores the folder's CHILDREN rather than the folder
# itself: git does not descend into an excluded DIRECTORY, so a
# `projects/*/sheet/` line would make the negation below unreachable.
projects/*/sheet/*
!projects/*/sheet/sheet.map
projects/*test
